## Interface: 30300
## Title: AscensionCrafter Export
## Notes: Exports gear stats and character sheet numbers for AscensionCrafter theorycrafting. Companion to inspects.nie.one (which covers spec/talent/gear-ID capture) - this covers full per-slot item stats plus live sheet numbers (per-school Spell Power, crit/hit/haste/expertise/armor pen). /ace start ... /ace stop brackets a whole dungeon.
